00:00:46,489 --> 00:00:48,466
feature you heard about, but in a nutshell,

20
00:00:48,578 --> 00:00:51,004
you can always just write JavaScript code

21
00:00:51,470 --> 00:00:54,287
and it will work. Because TypeScript builds

22
00:00:54,319 --> 00:00:57,218
up on JavaScript, all JavaScript code is

23
00:00:57,348 --> 00:00:58,472
supported in TypeScript.

24
00:01:00,212 --> 00:01:02,687
Therefore, we can use this regular

