45
00:01:51,691 --> 00:01:53,438
But why does my IDE know this?

46
00:01:54,319 --> 00:01:56,499
In the end, because of TypeScript.

47
00:01:57,059 --> 00:01:59,335
Because it knows that when we select a

48
00:01:59,463 --> 00:02:00,970
