53
00:02:12,267 --> 00:02:14,847
We didn't define this type explicitly.

54
00:02:15,552 --> 00:02:18,645
I didn't add colon HTML button element here,

55
00:02:19,014 --> 00:02:19,542
though I could.

56
00:02:20,376 --> 00:02:21,690
But we don't need to do this here

57
00:02:22,219 --> 00:02:25,343
because TypeScript is able to infer types.

58
00:02:25,664 --> 00:02:28,051
And it's really smart regarding that. It's

59
00:02:28,132 --> 00:02:30,728
able to find out which type of value will

60
00:02:30,856 --> 00:02:33,003
eventually be stored in this constant

61
00:02:33,195 --> 00:02:34,910
because of this code here.

62
00:02:35,519 --> 00:02:36,865
And that's pretty nice, of course.

