123
00:05:11,134 --> 00:05:12,705
Now here we need numbers.

124
00:05:13,475 --> 00:05:16,377
So here the fix is easy. We convert this.

125
00:05:16,746 --> 00:05:18,878
But now we are forced to make that

126
00:05:18,910 --> 00:05:22,297
